<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CompUSA started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CompUSA started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Tom Cal started coverage of CompUSA Inc with short- and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- estimated per share estimates of $0.96 for fiscal 1997 and $1.15 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 3/8 at 21-3/8.</p>
</text>
